+| 19:07:21Z → 21:05:39Z | **Observation gap — no tool on the board probes telegram in this window** | (unobserved) | sentry passes 17-21 cover AI providers only |
+| 21:05:39.261Z | Window 2 observed: `httpStatus: null`, `fetch failed` | **DOWN** | This addendum, read 1 |
